source1_text:
ARTICLE 8 – FACULTY AFFAIRS COMMITTEE (FAC)
8.01 Purpose
Recognizing that the process of evaluating applications for sabbatical leaves, renewal, promotion and tenure involves a
peer-review process, there shall be a Faculty Affairs
Committee, whose purpose is to provide the President with reasoned recommendations on applications from members
with respect to:
(a) renewal of probationary appointments;
(b) promotion;
(c) tenure;
(d) research or travel fund allocation, when available;
(e) sabbatical

